    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Management, Strategy Reigns Supreme</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Economy System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become not just a battle commander, but a shrewd financial steward! Balance hero salaries, equipment purchases, and dynamic decisions like tax policies and adventurer benefits to ensure your team\u2019s survival and growth amid monster invasions. Every coin you invest yields returns\u2014adventurers will use spare funds to train, upgrade gear, and sharpen their skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class Synergies &amp; Relic Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful united strength effects by strategically pairing heroes of different classes. Combine these with mystical relics to forge an adventurer army unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Policies, Adapt to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Policy Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to your guild\u2019s evolving challenges with tailored policies. Shift strategies between crisis management and rapid growth\u2014cut taxes to retain talent during a recession, or slash benefits to fund emergency defenses against a demonic siege. Survive bankruptcy today to thrive tomorrow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Adventures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests &amp; Random Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispatch teams on randomly generated quests, face unpredictable events, and encounter diverse heroes to recruit. Every choice reshapes your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique DBG Twist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice isn\u2019t always defeat. Will you nurture your veterans into legends, or embrace attrition as a strategy? Sometimes, fallen heroes leave rare relics\u2026 and bold heroes emerge when rewards are high.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Management, Strategy Reigns Supreme</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Economy System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become not just a battle commander, but a shrewd financial steward! Balance hero salaries, equipment purchases, and dynamic decisions like tax policies and adventurer benefits to ensure your team\u2019s survival and growth amid monster invasions. Every coin you invest yields returns\u2014adventurers will use spare funds to train, upgrade gear, and sharpen their skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class Synergies &amp; Relic Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful united strength effects by strategically pairing heroes of different classes. Combine these with mystical relics to forge an adventurer army unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Policies, Adapt to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Policy Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to your guild\u2019s evolving challenges with tailored policies. Shift strategies between crisis management and rapid growth\u2014cut taxes to retain talent during a recession, or slash benefits to fund emergency defenses against a demonic siege. Survive bankruptcy today to thrive tomorrow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Adventures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests &amp; Random Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispatch teams on randomly generated quests, face unpredictable events, and encounter diverse heroes to recruit. Every choice reshapes your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique DBG Twist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice isn\u2019t always defeat. Will you nurture your veterans into legends, or embrace attrition as a strategy? Sometimes, fallen heroes leave rare relics\u2026 and bold heroes emerge when rewards are high.</p>",
